# Binaries
/bin/
/dist/
/epistemicos-api
/epistemicos-cli
# Windows: `go build ./cmd/epistemicos-cli/` emits epistemicos-cli.exe, which
# the extensionless patterns above do not cover.
/epistemicos-api.exe
/epistemicos-cli.exe

# Test artifacts
*.test
*.out
coverage.out

# Local config — NEVER commit. Contains Mathpix and database credentials.
# Glob-matched deliberately: Notepad silently saves ".env" as ".env.txt",
# which an exact-name rule would miss and `git add -A` would then stage.
.env*
!.env.example

# IDE
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
.DS_Store

# Local agent-tool settings (user-scoped, not project artefacts)
.claude/

# Local PDF / data volume
/data/

# Sample conversions in the working root. Anchored with a leading slash so it
# cannot reach test fixtures: internal/core/domain/segment/testdata/demo.md is
# the Step 3 reference fixture (§15) and MUST be committed. An unanchored
# `demo*.md` matched it at every depth and silently excluded it.
/demo*.md
